# Reviewed exclusions from the Debian ca-certificates package.
# One exact path per line, relative to /usr/share/ca-certificates:
#   mozilla/Example_Root_CA.crt
#
# The default (with no exclusions) is all roots shipped by the pinned Debian
# package, matching Debian's initial package configuration. Any named root
# must exist in that package; a typo or stale exclusion fails the build.
# Unlike Debian's /etc/ca-certificates.conf, entries here exclude, not include.
